A printed message stacking more than one reason.
-- hit/diagnostic --
denied because the cache is shared, so write elsewhere
refused; the row is ended, which no exec revives
-- hit/diagnostic whole --
refused because x
retry, meaning y
-- pass/diagnostic --
the cache dir is magus's own, so write under .magus/tmp
run `a so b because c` instead
the words "so" and "because" are joins
also absorbs the sonic boom
